A '''super combat potion''' is a [[Herblore#Potions|potion]] made by using either a [[torstol]] or a [[torstol potion (unf)]] on any 4-dose of: [[super attack]], [[super strength]], or [[super defence]], while having one 4-dose of each in the player's inventory. This requires 90 [[Herblore]], and yields a super combat (4) and 150 Herblore [[experience]]. A dose of super combat potion provides a [[temporary skill boost]] to [[Attack]], [[Strength]], and [[Defence]] level respectively of 5 + 15%, rounded down.

Creating a super combat potion in the [[Varrock west bank]] is a requirement of the [[Elite Varrock Diary]].

==Effects==
Stat boosts to Attack, Strength and Defence are calculated with: <math>\lfloor SkillLevel \times \frac{15}{100} \rfloor + 5</math>

Stat boosts will decay at a rate of 1 point per minute, or 90 seconds with the use of [[Preserve]].
